{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T16:25:54.391Z","ordinal":15704,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a02f71-5fd7-7ed3-ae69-beb76a83519b","author":"/root/phase2_privacy","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/phase2_privacy\nPayload:\nPhase 2 privacy integration is complete in my owned files.\n\n- Whole-cache v2 reset is wired into shared exclude/purge cleanup, with dry-run/transaction inventory.\n- Verification strictly reads/parses the bounded v2 cache and flags tombstoned source owners or opaque/malformed data.\n- Atomic v2 cache temp orphans are classified for purge/verify.\n- Publish bundle regression confirms the cache stays local.\n- Added purge, false-clean, opaque-cache, orphan, and bundle regressions.\n\nPerformance impact: one descriptor-checked cache stat during planning/cleanup; verification adds a bounded 8 MiB parse only when the cache exists.\n\nFocused normal tests passed before a concurrent core edit. Current package tests are temporarily blocked by unrelated in-flight `runDistillCandidateShadowV2` missing definition in `distill_cmd.go`; formatting and diff checks pass."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a02f65-7c17-7a30-9a2a-f255f8bc2ae4"}}}
