iew\":\"title: Store Checkpoints in Another Repository\\n\\n## Where to click first\\n## Limits and caveats\\n### Push through the mirror\"}]},{\"question\":\"Which trees should the Chicago pass cover? (docs/ and entire-graph/ are separate git repos.)\",\"header\":\"Scope\",\"multiSelect\":true,\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Public docs site (126 .mdx)\",\"description\":\"Everything in docs/ except the Mintlify boilerplate (essentials/) and the placeholder Plant API pages (api-reference/endpoint/), which are vendor template leftovers. Includes guides/graph/, the graph section of the public site.\"},{\"label\":\"entire-graph current docs (11 .md)\",\"description\":\"The top-level files in entire-graph/docs/: README, agents, commands, search, benchmarks, language-support, operations, snapshot-format, trust-and-security, semantic-provider-requirements, brain-and-graph-boundaries.\"},{\"label\":\"entire-graph archive, ADRs, evidence (16 .md)\",\"description\":\"Historical records: docs/archive/ dated plans, docs/adr/ decision records, docs/evidence/. Copyediting these rewrites the historical record, so I would skip them by default.\"},{\"label\":\"Mintlify boilerplate too\",\"description\":\"Also Chicago-ize essentials/ and the Plant API placeholder pages in api-reference/, which are unmodified Mintlify template files.\"}]}]},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"stop_reason\":\"tool_use\",\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":1680,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":96170,\"output_tokens\":1339,\"output_tokens_details\":{\"thinking_tokens\":231},\"server_tool_use\":{\"web_search_requests\":0,\"web_fetch_requests\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":1680,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\",\"iterations\":[{\"input_tokens\":2,\"output_tokens\":1339,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":96170,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":1680,\"cache_creation\":