{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T17:08:33.471Z","ordinal":16932,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0873a68aa02aff8f016a8b291038308198928d27ff0b625000","status":"completed","call_id":"call_7SGE19MmqUSLC2KkLCQT4HO4","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({\"cmd\":\"git -C /Users/thomi/Projects/entire-graph status --short --branch && git diff --check && rg -n '/Users/|thomi|22bc80ae|docs/chicago-style' docs internal templates --glob '!docs/candidate_distillation_plan.md' | head -30\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-brain\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":10000});\ntext(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a02f65-7c17-7a30-9a2a-f255f8bc2ae4"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T17:08:33.674Z","ordinal":16933,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0200a-63d8-7b21-adef-c3850aecebf7","turn_id":"01a02f65-7c17-7a30-9a2a-f255f8bc2ae4","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-33b46f4c-bd0a-475e-b8ae-4cdea0210f28","process_id":"33129","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","git -C /Users/thomi/Projects/entire-graph status --short --branch && git diff --check && rg -n '/Users/|thomi|22bc80ae|docs/chicago-style' docs internal templates --glob '!docs/candidate_distillation_plan.md' | head -30"],"cwd":"file:///Users/thomi/Projects/entire-brain","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git -C /Users/thomi/Projects/entire-graph status --short --branch && git diff --check && rg -n '/Users/|thomi|22bc80ae|docs/chicago-style' docs internal templates --glob '!docs/candidate_distillation_plan.md' | head -30"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"## main...origin/main [behind 108]\ndocs/pattern_consolidation_plan.md:661:4. **Active redaction boundary.** `redactText` (tokens, JWTs, secret-looking env assignments, private-key blocks, GitHub tokens, `/Users/<name>` paths) is applied to synthesis evidence (the agent's input), rendered cards, transcript excerpts, drafts, and JSON egress.\ndocs/pattern_v2.md:1102:**Redaction hardening (found by running the extractor on the entire-cli brain, 22.9k episodes).** The shared `redactText` home-path pattern was capital-`/Users/`-only and missed contributor home paths typed lowercase on case-insensitive macOS volumes (`/users/<name>/…`) and home paths embedded in non-boundary contexts (`file:///Users/<name>`, gitbash `/c/Users/<name>`, Windows `C:\\Users\\<name>`, `sed 's|…|/Users/<name>/…|'`). The fix splits into two rules: **canonical roots** (`/Users/`, `\\Users\\`, `/home/`) are stripped wherever they appear (unambiguous home dirs); **lowercase `/users/`** is stripped only at a path-token boundary, so a lowercase-typed home is caught while API/repo paths (`api.github.com/users/<login>`, `…/platform/users/components`, `users/me`) are preserved. `pattern_indexer_version` bumped (→5) so existing corpora re-index under the stricter redaction. **Evidence**: on the CLI brain all audited home-username leaks and all `/Users|\\Users|/home/<name>` paths went to **0** while 8 API `/users/` paths were correctly preserved; `TestRedactText` covers file://, gitbash, Windows, sed, and API-preservation cases. This is shared infra, so it hardens redaction for facts/history/docs/brief/get across the whole product, not just patterns.\ninternal/cli/redaction.go:33:\t//   - macOS \"/Users/<name>\" or \"\\Users\\<name>\" (capital U is the OS-created dir)\ninternal/cli/redaction.go:71:\ts = reHomeCanonical.ReplaceAllString(s, \"${1}[redacted]\")      // preserve prefix (e.g. /Users/), drop username\ninternal/cli/pattern_deep_test.go:135:{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"ZEBRAFISH_CALIBRATION_NOTE staging toggle first; token REDACTED path /Users/alice/secret\"}]}}\ninternal/cli/pattern_deep_test.go:175:\tif strings.Contains(excerpts, \"REDACTED\") || strings.Contains(excerpts, \"/Users/alice\") {\ninternal/cli/pattern_deep_test.go:191:\tif strings.Contains(gotInput, \"REDACTED\") || strings.Contains(gotInput, \"/Users/alice\") {\ninternal/cli/pattern_quality_test.go:61:\t\t\tid, \"fact:deploy\", \"architecture\", \"/Users/example-user/secret REDACTED\"); err != nil {\ninternal/cli/brain_brief_compact_test.go:178:\treport.Status.Repo.Root = \"/Users/private/repository\"\ninternal/cli/brain_brief_compact_test.go:179:\treport.Status.Brain.Path = \"/Users/private/.entire/brain\"\ninternal/cli/brain_brief_compact_test.go:181:\treport.Status.Semantic.Provider.Snapshot = \"/Users/private/snapshot.ndjson\"\ninternal/cli/brain_brief_compact_test.go:182:\treport.Status.Semantic.Provider.Store = \"/Users/private/semantic.sqlite\"\ninternal/cli/brain_brief_compact_test.go:190:\tfor _, forbidden := 