{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T17:43:50.548Z","ordinal":17028,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0200a-63d8-7b21-adef-c3850aecebf7","turn_id":"01a02fb8-5db4-77e3-a158-975075162964","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0873a68aa02aff8f016a8b3155001c8198b9bff3a2d2bf3a68","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The next bounded slice is Phase 3A: opt-in candidate writes using exact identity only. It will materialize validated v2 member results into branch fact stores, preserve legacy facts, create review proposals for any non-exact relationship, and keep automatic paraphrase/supersession disabled. The full labeled Phase 2 evaluation remains an independent promotion gate.\n\nI’m branching from the pushed Phase 2 commit and splitting implementation, storage, and gate design across Terra/Luna agents."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787507028993,"completed_at_ms":1787507030547}}
