{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T17:51:04.809Z","ordinal":17270,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a02fbf-5a69-7c22-8588-423e5c6cc6a1","author":"/root/phase3_materializer","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/phase3_materializer\nPayload:\nImplemented in new files only:\n\n- `internal/cli/distill_materialize_v2.go`\n- `internal/cli/distill_materialize_v2_test.go`\n\nAPI:\n\n- `materializeDistillCandidateResultV2(result, target, now)`\n- `applyDistillCandidateResultV2(active, result, target, now)`\n\nBehavior includes strict result/target validation, explicit empty success, deterministic content-derived IDs, sorted receipt-facing `FactIDs`, exact provenance anchors, distilled/active timestamps, authored/legacy anchor preservation, and exact-only application through `newDistilledFactActions`/`applyFactActions`.\n\nFocused tests pass:\n\n```text\ngo test ./internal/cli -run 'Test(Materialize|ApplyDistillCandidate)' -count=1\nok\n```\n\nThe full CLI suite was started but interrupted after several minutes due unrelated long-running integration tests."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a02fb8-5db4-77e3-a158-975075162964"}}}
