{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T17:52:58.689Z","ordinal":17298,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a02fc1-1741-7111-bda8-35f0984c1551","author":"/root/phase3_receipts","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/phase3_receipts\nPayload:\nImplemented only new files:\n\n- [distill_applications_v2.go](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-brain/internal/cli/distill_applications_v2.go)\n- [distill_applications_v2_test.go](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-brain/internal/cli/distill_applications_v2_test.go)\n\nPrimitive details:\n\n- Bounded versioned NDJSON at `facts/distill-v2/applications.ndjson`.\n- Atomic brain-relative `0600` I/O.\n- Strict parsing, unknown-field rejection, canonical slot ordering, size/entry limits.\n- No card/provider text; stores only digests, IDs, branch/session/path/checkpoint identity.\n- Stable slot identity: branch + source session + candidate ID.\n- Full identity invalidation includes result/source/provenance/path/checkpoint/fact-store generation.\n- `LookupSuccess`, `PutSuccess`, `PutSuccessReplacing`, `LookupSlot`, `RemoveSlot`.\n- `PruneUnseenSlots` and `PruneUnseenSlotsWithReceipts` for current-set reconciliation.\n- Result/provenance digest helpers.\n- Tests cover determinism, strict parsing, bounds, identity misses, replacement, explicit empty results, and pruning.\n\nVerification:\n\n- Focused receipt tests passed before concurrent core integration edits.\n- `gofmt` and `git diff --check` pass.\n- Current package test compilation is blocked by the concurrent undefined `runDistillCandidateApplyV2` reference in `distill_cmd.go`; I did not modify that owned-out-of-scope file.\n\nIntegration/privacy hooks remain intentionally external: load/save under the brain write lock, retract `AppliedFactIDs` from replaced/pruned receipts, purge receipts by source session tombstone, and exclude `facts/distill-v2` from bundles."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a02fb8-5db4-77e3-a158-975075162964"}}}
