t reduced 33,663,145\n-legacy-preprocessed bytes to 1,415,420 rendered candidate bytes (a 95.8 percent\n+legacy-preprocessed bytes to 1,417,956 rendered candidate bytes (a 95.8 percent\n reduction) and removed all\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /Users/thomi/Projects/entire-brain/docs/candidate_distillation_plan.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1787508421978,"completed_at_ms":1787508421980}}
