nciliation fixtures remain required before promotion\n+or any default change.\n+\n This plan replaces full-conversation fact extraction with a candidate-first\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /Users/thomi/Projects/entire-brain/docs/candidate_distillation_plan.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1787508429443,"completed_at_ms":1787508429444}}
