{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T18:13:06.601Z","ordinal":18037,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0200a-63d8-7b21-adef-c3850aecebf7","turn_id":"01a02fb8-5db4-77e3-a158-975075162964","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0873a68aa02aff8f016a8b382fe7688198ac9276fcb5ee3ed6","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"A second preservation edge is confirmed: a legacy distilled fact can legitimately have no provenance, so a single undifferentiated v2 anchor cannot tell “created by v2” from “shared exact match” after a crash. I’m encoding owned-vs-shared directly in the anchor marker; that makes deletion decisions recoverable from the fact file itself, independent of receipts."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787508783913,"completed_at_ms":1787508786601}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T18:13:06.607Z","ordinal":18038,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0873a68aa02aff8f016a8b382fe7688198ac9276fcb5ee3ed6","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"A second preservation edge is confirmed: a legacy distilled fact can legitimately have no provenance, so a single undifferentiated v2 anchor cannot tell “created by v2” from “shared exact match” after a crash. I’m encoding owned-vs-shared directly in the anchor marker; that makes deletion decisions recoverable from the fact file itself, independent of receipts."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a02fb8-5db4-77e3-a158-975075162964"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T18:13:09.228Z","ordinal":18039,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0873a68aa02aff8f016a8b383298f08198a68946a4f6b1b21b","status":"completed","call_id":"call_UBzAC3OxewhHoNDp2rLNdlpW","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/thomi/Projects/entire-brain/internal/cli/distill_apply_runner_v2.go\\n@@\\n const (\\n-\\tdistillCandidateIDPrefixV1                = \\\"candidate-v1:\\\"\\n-\\tdistillCandidateApplicationAnchorPrefixV2 = \\\"candidate-application-v2:\\\"\\n+\\tdistillCandidateIDPrefixV1                     = \\\"candidate-v1:\\\"\\n+\\tdistillCandidateApplicationOwnedPrefixV2       = \\\"candidate-application-v2-owned:\\\"\\n+\\tdistillCandidateApplicationSharedPrefixV2      = \\\"candidate-application-v2-shared:\\\"\\n )\\n@@\\n-\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tTriggerTurnID: distillCandidateApplicationAnchorIDV2(candidateID),\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tTriggerTurnID: distillCandidateApplicationAnchorIDV2(candidateID, false),\\n@@\\n \\t\\t\\tmaterialized, err := materializeDistillCandidateResultV2(application.Result, application.Target, now)\\n \\t\\t\\tif err != nil {\\n \\t\\t\\t\\treturn err\\n \\t\\t\\t}\\n+\\t\\t\\tmaterialized = assignDistillApplicationAnchorOwnershipV2(materialized, facts, application.Target.SourceSessionID, application.Target.CandidateID)\\n \\t\\t\\tmaterialized.Facts = applyEntityProvenance(materialized.Facts, opts.entityProvenance)\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a02fb8-5db4-77e3-a158-975075162964"}}}
