{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T18:18:20.548Z","ordinal":18239,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a02fd8-4ffe-7970-809d-386505082962","author":"/root/phase3_privacy_final","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/phase3_privacy_final\nPayload:\nPrivacy/lifecycle review complete. No HIGH/MEDIUM blockers found.\n\nVerified:\n\n- Purge plan/execution both inventory and reset v2 application receipts.\n- Receipt verification fails closed on malformed, opaque, forward-version, or oversized data.\n- Tombstoned receipt owners are detected.\n- Atomic receipt temp orphans are inventoried and removed.\n- Shared v2 anchors are stripped without deleting legacy/authored facts; owned anchors can delete v2-only facts.\n- Legacy provenance and authored facts remain preserved.\n- Hosted publish excludes receipt and candidate-cache artifacts.\n- Focused privacy/publish/application tests pass.\n- Race suite passes:\n\n```text\ngo test -race ./internal/cli -run 'Privacy|Publish|DistillApplication' -count=1\nok .../internal/cli 20.302s\n```\n\nOne non-blocking hardening note: arbitrary unknown regular files placed under `facts/distill-v2/` are not inventoried, but the implemented receipt path and its atomic temp pattern are covered."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a02fb8-5db4-77e3-a158-975075162964"}}}
