{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T18:18:22.657Z","ordinal":18243,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a02fd8-5841-7ae1-b19d-fcac9bfc8db3","call_id":"call_ukX7I83Fj9s1YCBO7LTaraA7","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/phase3_privacy_final\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Privacy/lifecycle review complete. No HIGH/MEDIUM blockers found.\\n\\nVerified:\\n\\n- Purge plan/execution both inventory and reset v2 application receipts.\\n- Receipt verification fails closed on malformed, opaque, forward-version, or oversized data.\\n- Tombstoned receipt owners are detected.\\n- Atomic receipt temp orphans are inventoried and removed.\\n- Shared v2 anchors are stripped without deleting legacy/authored facts; owned anchors can delete v2-only facts.\\n- Legacy provenance and authored facts remain preserved.\\n- Hosted publish excludes receipt and candidate-cache artifacts.\\n- Focused privacy/publish/application tests pass.\\n- Race suite passes:\\n\\n```text\\ngo test -race ./internal/cli -run 'Privacy|Publish|DistillApplication' -count=1\\nok .../internal/cli 20.302s\\n```\\n\\nOne non-blocking hardening note: arbitrary unknown regular files placed under `facts/distill-v2/` are not inventoried, but the implemented receipt path and its atomic temp pattern are covered.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/phase3_quality_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Final H/M review: no HIGH/MEDIUM blockers found.\\n\\nThe owned/shared marker logic now handles the preservation edge correctly:\\n\\n- Pre-existing distilled/authored exact facts receive a `shared` marker.\\n- Newly created v2 facts receive an `owned` marker.\\n- Shared-only cleanup removes the candidate anchor but preserves the fact, including anchorless legacy facts.\\n- Owned facts are deleted only when their last owned v2 anchor is removed.\\n- Multiple exact v2 candidates propagate ownership; removing the first preserves the fact, while removing the last removes it.\\n- Receipt-present and receiptless crash recovery use the same durable marker logic.\\n- Phase 1/legacy anchors remain outside the validated v2 namespaces.\\n\\nFocused tests and `git diff --check` pass.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/phase3_runtime_review\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a02fb8-5db4-77e3-a158-975075162964"}}}
